    <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK = primary key, FK = foreign key, &lt;i&gt;italic&lt;/i&gt; = nullable column. Each FK row names the table it references.&lt;br&gt;A line starts at the FK row of the child table (crow-foot end) and ends at the header of the parent table.&lt;br&gt;Double bar = exactly one parent; circle and bar = zero or one parent (nullable FK).&lt;br&gt;(G1) … (G8) after a table name = that table is drawn in the diagram of that group, not here.&lt;br&gt;Dashed orange line = logical reference through payments.ref_type and payments.ref_id (no FK constraint in the database)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1e293b;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1040" width="900" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
